# tools/pipeline_seed.py record: the in-game states a sweep never sets up (every beam and visor, charge,
# missiles, the morph ball with bombs and boost, the pause menus). New game, Temple Grounds start.
# The @f lines run at game updates; the @<secs> tail runs while the game is paused.
